at":"2025-10-27T15:06:22Z"},"body":"*Bugsquad edit:* Depends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108853, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109103, and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107866.\r\n\r\nexposes \"export_gpu_instances\" option: https://docs.blender.org/api/4.0/bpy.ops.export_scene.html#bpy.ops.export_scene.gltf\r\n\r\nEnabling it will export instances and particle systems as GLTF's buffer/accessor data instead of numerous singular Mesh3D object. This does not include Geometry Nodes instancing.\r\n\r\nSmall project to test export with/without option: https://github.com/2frac/godot-gpu-instances-test\r\nIt also has small addon which actually creates and fills MultiMeshInstance3D using GLTFDocumentExtension. I might check if it is easy to add MultiMeshInstance3D creation to engine itself, but that seems like a separate task. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107672/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":6,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"time